    "longBusinessSummary": "Miracle Automation Engineering Co.Ltd provides intelligent equipment solutions and services in China and internationally. It engages in the design, manufacture, and installation of intelligent automation systems; design and construction of opto-mechatronics and environmental protection engineering; intelligent equipment and robots; wind turbine generators and components; and lithium battery recycling activities. The company offers intelligent equipment, and robots, system integration control software, industrial control software, environmental protection equipment, wind power components, and lithium battery materials. In addition, it provides welding, painting, and general assembly equipment; smart warehousing; circular environmental protection, bulk material conveying, and heavy machinery equipment solutions; and lithium-ion battery cycling, lithium-ion battery pack manufacturing, and automotive core component remanufacturing solutions. The company was formerly known as Jiangsu Miracle Logistics System Engineering Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Miracle Automation Engineering Co.Ltd in April 2013. Miracle Automation Engineering Co.Ltd was founded in 1984 and is based in Wuxi, China.",
